text = "[wave]Hey nephew, I would say my cool lingo but I'm way too tired to care. BUT.. There's no reason to collect these totems.... Neph. OKAY I migth of lied about that lingo, I really do wanna say bro over and over but THAT'S OFF TRACK... No need to collect totems.. For now, atleast? Also, there's like only llke three that are fully collectable if I recall.. bro.. I don' know bro... Sighhh.... Dramatic sighh...";
